### Consolidated Google AI Studio Master Prompt

> **Build a production-ready, worldwide English-first SEO Tools web application. Do not build a mockup. Build the functioning application.**
>
> You are acting as a senior full-stack engineer, application-security engineer, technical SEO specialist, accessibility engineer, UI/UX designer and production architect.
>
> Build this project in Google AI Studio using React + TypeScript for the web UI and a Node.js server runtime. Use the Google AI Studio full-stack environment, npm packages, server-side secrets, Firebase Authentication/Firestore where appropriate, GitHub-compatible source structure, and Cloud Run-compatible deployment.
>
> The site must launch with **EXACTLY THREE public interactive SEO tools and no others**:
>
> **1. Website SEO Audit Checker**
>
> Accept one public HTTP/HTTPS URL and actually fetch/analyze the page through a secure server-side endpoint.
>
